{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42993","headline":"早过棃岭喜雪书情呈崔判官 · 张起","name":"早过棃岭喜雪书情呈崔判官","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"度岭逢朝雪，行看马迹深。\n轻标南国瑞，寒慰北人心。\n皎洁停丹嶂，飘颻映绿林。\n共君歌乐土，无作白头吟。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张起","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_42993.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42993","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}